--[[
	Anomaly Coop - NPC group: third-party mods (G.A.M.M.A. and friends) that assume one player.
	Native hooks live in coop_npc_adapters.

	Every patch activates only when its mod's script exists; nothing here touches plain Anomaly 1.5.3 except
	what is said. Outside a session every patched function answers exactly like the original.

	Wrappers (host, with clients):
	  - schemes_ai_gamma.scheme_camper / scheme_cover (G.A.M.M.A. AI Rework): asked about a proxy, they run
	    with "the actor" = that proxy (they only recognise db.actor as the player).
	  - night_mutants.se_obj_outside_spawn_radius: a spawn point must be outside the radius of every player.
	  - visual_memory_manager.get_visible_value (Stealth Overhaul, only with stealth_mcm): the level decider
	    uses the observed player's outfit, movement and shot.
	  - Weapon Cover Tilt: the level decider also counts a proxy's manual tilt in the meeting safemode condition.
	  - gameplay_peace_zone (Rostok Duty peace zone): crimes are tracked per player (by proxy), so a client
	    shooting Duty does not set the host's crime bit and a client without crimes is not attacked.
	  - Stealth Kill Detection (Catspaw): a client's silent kill judged by the host (coop_npc_world) is
	    credited to that client's statistics (npc.stat).
	Native: AI Rework's private hit callback; corpse-action proxy hostility; per-player vision,
	marks and identity scopes; furniture-trader proximity through the existing update chain.
	SKD's actor-only hook stays intact: coop_npc_world already judges proxy silent kills and
	credits their owner here, so broadening SKD would duplicate that path.
	Loose-source rewrites: hxf damage classification, grok friendly-kill classification,
	smr civil-war classification.
	Their private early-return branches have no safe identity-only hook; preserve their complete
	mod bodies and reject changed versions rather than replacing their policies. Useful Idiots
	is handled separately by coop_npc_idiots, with token-aware checks derived from the original mod.
	Function rewrites (FUNCTION_REWRITES): G.A.M.M.A.'s ballistics (grok_bo) counts every player's hit where hits are applied.
	Stock _g.CActor__BeforeHitCallback (every machine with a player's actor): in a session a teammate's hit is not a
	friendly NPC's stray bullet: it counts, or the actor got the hurt sound and hit marks with no damage.

	Events: npc.stat host -> client { k = statistic id }
--]]

local tostring, tonumber, type, pairs, ipairs, pcall = tostring, tonumber, type, pairs, ipairs, pcall

local TAG = "compat"
local P -- coop_npc_players

local function log(fmt, ...) P.log(TAG, fmt, ...) end
local function report(what, err) P.report(TAG, what, err) end

local EV_STAT = "npc.stat"
local CIVIL_WAR_REWARD = "coop_g94_civil_reputation"

local installed = false
local host_on_told = false
local orig = {}
local applied = {} -- what got installed, for coop_status

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Source rewrites
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
